            "display_review": true,
            "star_rating": 5,
            "quote": "<h2><br/>“Absolutely love this piece! The fabric feels luxurious, the fit is spot-on, and it’s incredibly comfortable for all-day wear. You can really see the attention to detail in the stitching and finish. Arrived quickly and the packaging was beautiful too.”<br/><br/></h2>",
